  "design": {
    "idea": "First Ballast Clamp aha: throw your lantern over the gunport rail to clamp Mirror 1 west, step on the brass foot-pedal while unarmed to roll Mirror 2 and a Ballast Keg east, then double-bank to blast open the bulkhead and light the blue switch.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Ballast Clamp pins one rail object uphill while the unarmed foot-pedal rolls the rest downhill to split a linked pair.",
    "decisions": 8,
    "expert_s": 54,
    "reward": "opens_upper_ship_wings",
    "why": "Signature aha room introducing Ballast Clamp + Foot-Pedal + Ballast Keg synergy immediately after the mini-boss.",
